  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Like a trusted compass for your feet, the ASICS GEL-Kayano 20 guides every journey with precision. Launched in 2013, these sneakers blend comfort and innovation with dual GEL inserts and a GUIDANCE TRUSSTIC system for lasting support and stability mile after mile. Up top, the architectural aesthetics inspired by buildings and cars create a bold, distinctive look that reflects the technical aesthetic of the 2010s, whispering understated sophistication. Underneath, GEL cushioning in the rearfoot and forefoot absorbs impact to keep your stride light, no matter the distance. Featuring an upper with at least 30% synthetic fibre, these shoes strike a perfect balance between sustainability and performance without compromising on style. Carry the weight of history and the lightness of innovation with the ASICS GEL-Kayano 20.</p> <p><strong>ASICS GEL-Kayano 20 features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>FLUIDFIT cage upper ensures a supportive, glove-like fit.</li> <li>Criss-cross TPU application provides targeted support.</li> <li>Mesh underlays offer breathability.</li> <li>Rubber outsole delivers superior traction.</li> </ul><hr /><p>Twenty years of distance-running refinement come together in the ASICS GEL-Kayano 20, a milestone edition that celebrates two decades of the iconic Kayano franchise. Dual GEL technology in both the rearfoot and forefoot absorbs the impact of every footstrike, while the GUIDANCE TRUSSTIC system keeps your stride stable and efficient mile after mile. Architectural aesthetics inspired by the bold design language of the 2010s give the silhouette a distinctive look that carries just as much presence on the street as it does on the road.</p> <ul> <li>FLUIDFIT cage upper delivers a supportive, glove-like fit that adapts to your foot shape.</li> <li>Criss-cross TPU application provides targeted structural support across the midfoot.</li> <li>Mesh underlays keep airflow moving to reduce heat buildup on longer efforts.</li> <li>Dual GEL cushioning in the rearfoot and forefoot softens impact through every phase of your stride.</li> <li>GUIDANCE TRUSSTIC system enhances stability and promotes a natural, efficient gait cycle.</li> <li>Rubber outsole with multi-directional lugs delivers reliable traction across road surfaces.</li> <li>Upper constructed with at least 30% synthetic fiber, balancing performance and sustainability.</li> </ul> <p><strong>Cushioning & Road Feel</strong></p> <p>The dual-zone GEL setup is built for runners who go the distance, with rearfoot absorption managing heel-strike impact and forefoot GEL keeping toe-off smooth and responsive. Paired with the GUIDANCE TRUSSTIC system, the midsole geometry promotes a consistent, efficient stride whether you are logging easy recovery miles or pushing toward a personal best.</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS®</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS® GEL-Kayano 20 - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Pond/Black</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>1203A388-005</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Cat